    "nonblocking_notes": [
      "Finale (campaign rule 14): three twists (mystery_piece 'Lucky Dip' NEW, storm_bolt 'Fireworks' from 09, fever_rush 'Carousel Fever' from 03) plus one mechanic (golden_row 'Prize Row' from 01). Ringmaster Ruffle is the face of the Lucky Dip and the Fireworks; Carousel Fever and the Prize Row are the player's counters.",
      "g0 1.55 is 0.055 below F2 (1.605, which extrapolates F2 past its documented biome range 1-10).",
      "storm_bolt interval 12000 (09 used 9000) so a bolt and a Lucky Dip reveal rarely share a beat; validator should check telegraph overlap."
